<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 56 FOR THREE IN 2ND INNINGS VS ENGLAND.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 56 FOR THREE IN 2ND INNINGS VS ENGLAND.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 56 for the loss of three wickets in their second innings at stumps on day four of the first cricket test against England on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 390. Second innings 56 for three wickets (A.Parore 16 not out).</p>
<p>England first innings 521 (overnight 366 for six) (A.Stewart 173, M.Atherton 83, G.Thorpe 119, D.Cork 59).</p>
